Drifting Hazard - Lake Ontario - Oakville
Semi-submerged derelict bowrider 6 metres in length reported adrift in the vicinity of 43 29.8N 079 32.0W at 211935 UTC Oct 2026. The vessel is marked with an orange marker.</description><MultiGeometry><Point><coordinates>-79.5333,43.4967,0</coordinates></Point></MultiGeometry></Placemark>
